<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container policy-page">
  <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>

  <h3>Delivery Time</h3>
  <p>We aim to deliver every order as quickly as possible:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Inside Dhaka:</strong> 1–2 business days</li>
    <li><strong>Outside Dhaka:</strong> 3–5 business days</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Delivery times may occasionally be longer due to public holidays, weather, or courier delays outside our control.</p>

  <h3>Delivery Charge</h3>
  <p>Delivery charges are calculated automatically at checkout based on your delivery location (inside or outside Dhaka).</p>

  <h3>Order Tracking</h3>
  <p>Once your order is shipped, you can check its status any time from your <a href="/account">Account</a> page. For any question about your order, contact us using the chat button on this site or call us at <%= shopPhone %>.</p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
